msgstr "A gap in the observation drops the whole time step; a gap in single ensemble members drops only those members, and the number of members in the formula is the number of valid ones. ``\"propagate\"`` returns NaN for any gap, ``\"raise\"`` raises ``ValueError`` (also for ensemble members)."

