msgid "AUC равна вероятности того, что случайно выбранной паре «событие / не событие» вероятность события присвоена выше у события; совпадения считаются как половина :footcite:p:`fawcett2006`. Прямой пересчёт по парам:"
msgstr "AUC equals the probability that, for a randomly chosen pair of an event and a non-event, the event gets the higher probability, ties counting as one half :footcite:p:`fawcett2006`. A direct recalculation over pairs:"

msgid ""
"positive = prob_sim[event_obs == 1]\n"
"negative = prob_sim[event_obs == 0]\n"
"greater = (positive[:, None] > negative[None, :]).mean()\n"
"ties = (positive[:, None] == negative[None, :]).mean()\n"
"print(round(float(greater + 0.5 * ties), 6), round(float(hm.roc_auc(event_obs, prob_sim)), 6))"
msgstr ""
"positive = prob_sim[event_obs == 1]\n"
"negative = prob_sim[event_obs == 0]\n"
"greater = (positive[:, None] > negative[None, :]).mean()\n"
"ties = (positive[:, None] == negative[None, :]).mean()\n"
"print(round(float(greater + 0.5 * ties), 6), round(float(hm.roc_auc(event_obs, prob_sim)), 6))"

